{"id":69004,"date":"2025-09-23T23:17:31","date_gmt":"2025-09-23T22:17:31","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=69004"},"modified":"2026-09-29T17:52:06","modified_gmt":"2026-09-29T16:52:06","slug":"meia-maratona-pombal","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/meia-maratona-pombal\/","title":{"rendered":"Meia Maratona de Pombal Full Protein 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Meia Maratona de Pombal Full Protein 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>Meia Maratona de Pombal Full Protein 2026<\/strong> (30\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o) realiza-se no dia <strong>29 de Novembro de 2026<\/strong> (Domingo), com partida \u00e0s <strong>10:00<\/strong> no centro da cidade de <strong>Pombal, Leiria<\/strong>. Com percurso homologado pela Federa\u00e7\u00e3o Portuguesa de Atletismo e World Athletics, a prova comemora tr\u00eas d\u00e9cadas de hist\u00f3ria como uma das meias maratonas mais consagradas e r\u00e1pidas do atletismo nacional.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O programa desportivo apresenta a emblem\u00e1tica <strong>Meia Maratona de 21,097 km<\/strong> (aberta a atletas nascidos em 2006 e anos anteriores) e uma acess\u00edvel <strong>Corrida de 8 km<\/strong> (para nascidos em 2008 e anteriores). O tra\u00e7ado em asfalto plano convida \u00e0 obten\u00e7\u00e3o de recordes pessoais, integrando postos de abastecimento a cada 5 km, cronometragem eletr\u00f3nica por chip Lap2Go, assist\u00eancia m\u00e9dica de emerg\u00eancia e medalha de finalista no final da meta.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o oficial \u00e9 promovida pelo <strong>Munic\u00edpio de Pombal<\/strong>, com a aprova\u00e7\u00e3o e parecer t\u00e9cnico da <strong>Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Distrital de Atletismo de Leiria (ADAL)<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data &#038; Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapsho